{"version":1,"content":"<p>「旅遊達人」梁芷珮（Christy）與老公黎卓穎（Kenneth）婚後育有2子1女，一家5口生活美滿。</p><p>Christy與老公多年來不時走訪世界各地拍攝旅遊片段，其製作的無綫旅遊節目《潮什麼》系列深受觀眾歡迎。</p><p>Christy日前於社交網晒相，分</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:17:26.018046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:01:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321520+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.321520+00:00","content_hash":"b5ae5c6493fdfbf7119616649bcd134eed05a2f2dc5036534b1b1012501e9052","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}